-- These 8 tables establish the core infrastructure and security foundation
-- for an enterprise-grade application, enabling:
--   1. Controlled database schema evolution (schema_migrations)
--   2. API abuse prevention and SLA enforcement (rate_limits)
--   3. Secure user session management (sessions)
--   4. Third-party application integration (api_clients)
--   5. Centralized secret management (secrets_manager)
--   6. Encryption key hierarchy (encryption_keys)
--   7. Long-term compliance audit storage (audit_log_archive)
--   8. Data classification and protection (data_classification)
-- =============================================================================

